WEBVTT

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:31.906
Harnessing that sense
of hating regret works.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.682
And it leads to the more general point,

00:07:34.706 --> 00:07:38.222
which is: once you recognize
how people are irrational,

00:07:38.246 --> 00:07:41.735
you're in a much better
position to help them.

00:07:42.174 --> 00:07:47.026
Now, this kind of irrationality works out
even in men's restrooms.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:51.850
So, for those of you
who don't frequent urinals,

00:07:51.874 --> 00:07:53.525
let me break this down for you.

00:07:53.549 --> 00:07:54.762
(Laughter)

00:07:54.786 --> 00:07:56.400
There is pee all over the floor.

00:07:56.424 --> 00:07:58.790
(Laughter)

00:07:59.164 --> 00:08:01.667
And it turns out that you
can solve this problem